      </span>\n    \n              \n              <div className=\"h-14 mb-1\">\n                <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug line-clamp-2 group-hover200 transition\">\n                  Tropical Architecture Trends in Bali 2026\n                </h3>\n              </div>\n    \n              \n              <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-300 line-clamp-2 mb-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                Discover how sustainable materials and open-plan concepts are reshaping modern luxury villas across Bali...\n              </p>\n    \n              \n              <div className=\"border-t border-white/20 pt-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                <svg className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-gray-300 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\" />\n                </svg>\n                <time className=\"text-xs text-gray-300\" datetime=\"2026-10-11\">\n                  Oct 11, 2026\n                </time>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n    \n          \n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"group relative h-72 sm80 overflow-hidden bg-gray-900 shadow-sm hover transition\">\n            <img \n              src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?q=80&w=800\" \n              alt=\"FIND Design Wins Best Architectural Excellence Award\"\n              loading=\"lazy\" \n              className=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover105 transition duration-300\"\n            />\n    \n            <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n    \n            <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-5 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n              <span className=\"self-start text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase px-2.5 py-1 mb-2.5 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white\">\n                News\n              </span>\n    \n              <div className=\"h-14 mb-1\">\n                <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug line-clamp-2 group-hover200 transition\">\n                  FIND Design Wins Best Architectural Excellence Award\n                </h3>\n              </div>\n    \n              <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-300 line-clamp-2 mb-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                Our firm has been recognized nationally for pushing the boundaries of tropical contemporary architecture...\n              </p>\n    \n              <div className=\"border-t border-white/20 pt-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                <svg className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-gray-300 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\" />\n                </svg>\n                <time className=\"text-xs text-gray-300\" datetime=\"2026-09-25\">\n                  Sep 25, 2026\n                </time>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n    \n          \n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"group relative h-72 sm80 overflow-hidden bg-gray-900 shadow-sm hover transition\">\n            <img \n              src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?q=80&w=800\" \n              alt=\"Behind the Scenes: Site Visit to Gianyar Project\"\n              loading=\"lazy\" \n              className=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover105 transition duration-300\"\n            />\n    \n            <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n    \n            <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-5 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n              <span className=\"self-start text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase px-2.5 py-1 mb-2.5 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white\">\n                Event\n              </span>\n    \n              <div className=\"h-14 mb-1\">\n                <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold text-white leading-snug line-clamp-2 group-hover200 transition\">\n                  Behind the Scenes: Site Visit to Gianyar Project\n                </h3>\n              </div>\n    \n              <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-300 line-clamp-2 mb-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                Take an exclusive look at the structural progress and material selection for our ongoing cliffside retreat...\n              </p>\n    \n              <div className=\"border-t border-white/20 pt-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                <svg className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-gray-300 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\" />\n                </svg>\n                <time className=\"text-xs text-gray-300\" datetime=\"2026-09-24\">\n                  Sep 24, 2026\n                </time>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n    \n        </div>\n    \n        \n        <div className=\"flex justify-center mt-12\">\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-gray-400 bg-transparent px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover900 hover900 hover transition duration-200\">\n            View All Articles\n            <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n              <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\" />\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n    \n      </div>\n    </section>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
